{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受描写在音乐细节、身体感受和情绪转折的精细程度上明显不如X，尤其缺少X那种随乐句推进的层次感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物经历和感受分开呈现，左侧自然连贯的叙述让普通观众更容易迅速理解人物处境、行为动机和前后变化；右侧短词也能补充情绪，不必同时处理太多层信息。X的重点加亮、分段和音乐同步出现的感受确实更有表现力，细节也丰富得多，但部分屏幕的信息竞争比较强，而且有些补写让人物心理变得比Y更确定，甚至略微改变了原有的情感分寸。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选Y：它更容易让观众在听音乐的同时读懂一个完整的人，而不只是接收到更多细腻的描述。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ea929e5e-93eb-4498-91cd-20c06b62b171", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163605120823Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.843, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:37:16.972199+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fe31d05896ce2e80f80bbac19ef61ec5c33c9997e38e09c0d046dd47b6fd20f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa